{"id":"59be57c107bd283a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-schnorr-success.md","title":"可计算鞅的 Schnorr 强成功","display":"df-schnorr-success — 可计算鞅的 Schnorr 强成功","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-schnorr-success","aliases":["43-df-schnorr-success"],"display":"df-schnorr-success — 可计算鞅的 Schnorr 强成功","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","[[43-df-computable-order]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-schnorr-success"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-schnorr-success</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schnorr-success — 可计算鞅的 Schnorr 强成功"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"57fbcf0c4946d61a\" href=\"?note=57fbcf0c4946d61a\" title=\"43-df-computable-order\">43-df-computable-order</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(d:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" href=\"?note=4aa7579d0d4e75dc\" title=\"43-df-computable-martingale\">43-df-computable-martingale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"57fbcf0c4946d61a\" href=\"?note=57fbcf0c4946d61a\" title=\"43-df-computable-order\">43-df-computable-order</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\">\\((2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的二元布尔谓词，参数依次为资本函数与序列，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处“强成功”是源书Schnorr的可计算无界速度意义；与有效维数中的liminf成功概念不同，特用独立符号避免混淆。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-order","status":"resolved","id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"4aa7579d0d4e75dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 分别见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable-order","status":"resolved","id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 分别见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}","display":false},{"tex":"(2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0})\\times2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrSucceeds}(d,X)\\iff\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}(d)\\land\\exists h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\land\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(n\\ge N\\land d(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge h(n)\\bigr)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1556,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-success]] — 可计算鞅的 Schnorr 强成功"},{"id":"f98755188bbee776","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$；谓词见 [[43-df-schnorrrandom]]、[[43-df-schnorr-success]]。"}],"outgoing":["4aa7579d0d4e75dc","57fbcf0c4946d61a"]}